            "block_content": "MEMORANDUM OF UNDERSTANDING\nBetween The\nCOMMONWEALTH OF MASSACHUSETTS\nAnd The\nMASSACHUSETTS ORGANIZATION OF STATE ENGINEERS AND SCIENTISTS",
            "block_bbox": [
