        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Regarding Out-of-Title Assignments at the Massachusetts Hi ghway Department",
            "block_bbox": [
                140,
                402,
                1057,
                432
            ],
            "block_id": 1,
            "block_order": 2,
            "group_id": 1,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    140.0,
                    402.0
                ],
                [
                    1057.0,
                    402.0
                ],
                [
                    1057.0,
                    432.0
                ],
                [
                    140.0,
                    432.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "1. When it has been determined by the Massachusetts Highway Department (MHD), or through the grievance process, that an employee is working in a higher classification, that employee shall be compensated for said out-of-title assignment via the normal payroll cycle if the out-of-title assignment is reasonably expected to last longer than six months.",
            "block_bbox": [
                140,
                460,
                1081,
                603
            ],
            "block_id": 2,
            "block_order": 3,
            "group_id": 2,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    140.0,
                    460.0
                ],
                [
                    1081.0,
                    460.0
                ],
                [
                    1081.0,
                    603.0
                ],
                [
                    140.0,
                    603.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. The determination whether or not an assignment will last longer than six months shall be the exclusive responsibility of MHD or its agent and sa id determination shall not be subject to the grievance process. However, when a determination has been made by MHD that an out of title assignment will not last longer than six months, and in fact said out of title assignment is subsequently paid for the six month period, the parties agree to hold a Step III hearing to ensure compliance with the terms of this memorandum. The results of this hearing shall not be subject to arbitration.",
            "block_bbox": [
                140,
                630,
                1083,
                858
            ],
            "block_id": 3,
            "block_order": 4,
            "group_id": 3,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    140.0,
                    630.0
                ],
                [
                    1083.0,
                    630.0
                ],
                [
                    1083.0,
                    858.0
                ],
                [
                    140.0,
                    858.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "3. Employees working out-of-title who do not fall under the provisions of this Memorandum shall continue to be paid according to past practice.",
            "block_bbox": [
                138,
                885,
                1081,
                944
            ],
            "block_id": 4,
            "block_order": 5,
            "group_id": 4,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    138.0,
                    885.0
                ],
                [
                    1081.0,
                    885.0
                ],
                [
                    1081.0,
                    944.0
                ],
                [
                    138.0,
                    944.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "4. Nothing in this Agreement shall preclude MHD, or its designee, from making the determination that an employee has been assigned responsibilities out of his/her classification.",
            "block_bbox": [
                138,
                971,
                1072,
                1057
            ],
            "block_id": 5,
            "block_order": 6,
            "group_id": 5,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    138.0,
                    971.0
                ],
                [
                    1072.0,
                    971.0
                ],
                [
                    1072.0,
                    1057.0
                ],
                [
                    138.0,
                    1057.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "5. Prior to the commencement of compensation for an out-of-title assignment as provided in paragraph #1 above, MOSES shall be given written notice of said assignment.",
            "block_bbox": [
                140,
                1085,
                1079,
                1171
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    140.0,
                    1085.0
                ],
                [
                    1079.0,
                    1085.0
                ],
                [
                    1079.0,
                    1171.0
                ],
                [
                    140.0,
                    1171.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "6. MOSES shall be given a copy of the notice employees are given after they have worked in a higher classification for more than 52 weeks.",
            "block_bbox": [
                139,
                1199,
                1068,
                1257
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    139.0,
                    1199.0
                ],
                [
                    1068.0,
                    1199.0
                ],
                [
                    1068.0,
                    1257.0
                ],
                [
                    139.0,
                    1257.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "7. Neither MOSES nor the employee waives any right to file a grievance regarding disputed dates or grade for the out-of-title assignment.",
            "block_bbox": [
                140,
                1284,
                1068,
                1343
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    140.0,
                    1284.0
                ],
                [
                    1068.0,
                    1284.0
                ],
                [
                    1068.0,
                    1343.0
                ],
                [
                    140.0,
                    1343.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "8. MOSES does not waive any right to file a grievance alleging that the work in a higher classification violates Article 14 or other provisions of the collective bargaining agreement.",
            "block_bbox": [
                139,
                1369,
                1070,
                1456
